    {"id":"proto-003","cat":"protocol","sub":"uart","type":"single","q":"UART 空闲时 TX/RX 线电平为？","options":["低","高","高阻","不确定"],"answer":1,"explain":"空闲高，起始位拉低。","src":""},
    {"id":"proto-004","cat":"protocol","sub":"uart","type":"single","q":"UART 数据位传输顺序是？","options":["MSB 先","LSB 先","并行","随机"],"answer":1,"explain":"UART 默认 LSB 先出。","src":""},
